          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بھڑانا (bhiṛānā) is the causative of bhiṛnā, \"to clash\": CDIAL lists the Hindi cousins bhiṛnā and bhiṛānā, \"to bring together\", under bhiṭ, \"meet, throng\", a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 9490)."
